// Elements Weapon Pack: six elemental weapons, three front (fire, ice, lightning), three rear
// (earth, acid, wind), eleven power levels each like the original weapons (front[] / rear[], MODDING.md 5.3).
//
// Shop icons: 24x28 gun housings built from the original shop icons and repainted per element
// by utils/elements_weapons_icons.py (game palette, near-black rim, two-step drop shadow).
// Shots: 12x14, four frames each, drawn by utils/elements_weapons_shots.py (shapes registered at run time
// in utils/mod_shot_draw.py). The frames <name>_1..4 get consecutive sprite slots, so "animation": 3
// cycles all four.
//
// Balance (README, utils/mod_weapon_balance.py): damage per second = salvo damage x 35 / (fire_delay + 1),
// compared at every level with the original weapons of the same price. POSITIVE speed_y = upward;
// sub_delay 255 = the shot lives until it leaves the screen (MODDING.md 5.4). This file is generated:
// keep the level tables and the README tables in step.
